##  Passive Recon Workflow

1. Identify target domain
2. Perform WHOIS lookup
3. Gather DNS records
4. Search for subdomains (OSINT sources)
5. Analyze social media presence
6. Review public code repositories
7. Extract metadata from documents
8. Document all findings

---

##  Information You Can Discover

- Domain infrastructure
- Subdomains and services
- Email formats
- Employee names and roles
- Technology stack
- Publicly exposed files
- API endpoints (sometimes leaked)

---

##  Limitations

- Data may be outdated
- Not always accurate
- Restricted by privacy protections (WHOIS privacy, GDPR)
- Requires validation in later phases

---

##  Ethical Considerations

- Only collect publicly available data
- Do not bypass authentication or protections
- Respect privacy laws and regulations
- Use findings only for authorized testing

---

##  Tools to Practice OSINT

- TryHackMe OSINT rooms
